<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-AG19-R2-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-AG19-R2-004" ;
  triage:title "docs/atm-daemon/protocol-icd.md Section 7.1/7.1.1 still documents the deleted AckRequest/AckOutcome wire contract" ;
  triage:description "req-qa (AG19-FIX-1-QA-RECHECK-2, Blocking): docs/atm-daemon/protocol-icd.md Section 7.1 and 7.1.1 still document AckRequest/AckOutcome/SendRequestEnvelope/SendResponseEnvelope/send_acknowledge_request as the current wire contract. The actual current contract, per the AG.19 ack-path unification, is RequestEnvelope::Send(SendRequest) / ResponseEnvelope::Send(SendOutcome) with acknowledges_message_id as the ack discriminator. requirements.md names this ICD as the canonical daemon wire-contract doc, making this a real, blocking doc-drift defect -- same defect class as the now-closed ATM-QA-AG19-R1-001 (docs/architecture.md) but a different file that the R1 fix pass did not cover." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AG" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "ATM-QA" ;
  triage:severity "Blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "docs/atm-daemon/protocol-icd.md sections 7.1 and 7.1.1" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-20T05:11:33Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/ATM-QA-AG19-R2-004/pAG-s19/1> ;
  triage:fixedOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s19/d50e7c92> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s19/d50e7c92> ;
  triage:notes "FIXED at d50e7c92 per AG19-FIX-3-QA-RECHECK-1 (quality-mgr): protocol-icd.md sections 7.1/7.1.1 rewritten; zero remaining references to AckRequest/AckOutcome/SendRequestEnvelope/SendResponseEnvelope/send_acknowledge_request. Non-blocking nit deferred (req-qa): doc says RequestEnvelope::Send(SendRequest) but actual type is Send(Box<SendRequest>) -- does not reopen this finding, tracked for a future doc-precision tweak." .

